// Head writer 4: career lines. The Captain doesn't come to find you; these are if you meet her.
== career.worried
? tier>=acquaintance flag:career.up
- The Chief tells me things are better. I'm glad. I don't forget.
== career.bye
? tier>=acquaintance flag:career.lastday
- I asked you a question once. I still remember your answer. Go well, {me}.   #warm
